    backlog:hasExclusionRationale "The content was approved by the owner earlier; only its form is corrected. An example is changed only where a ruling forces it (a prompt, a lambda, a frame that does not parse, an analogy). A story repeated across chapters is reported, not changed, without the owner; the name Ken Thompson shared by the chapter 12 story with chapters 8, 9 and 10 is read by a person and reported." ;
