    backlog:hasForecastRationale "Corrected 2026-11-26 10:12 after the Owner's objection that the first dates were too long. The first date (2026-12-07) extrapolated the elapsed days of Lineage10 (three chapters in eight days), but those days were mostly waiting for rulings, an urgency lineage and tool faults, not work. Read from git: a chapter went from spec to released deck and page in about 35 minutes (chapter 11, 2026-11-18), 30 minutes (chapters 11 and 10, 2026-11-24) and about 4 hours (chapter 17, 2026-11-20 13:15 to 17:14); a full page test takes 15 to 20 minutes. Four chapters at the upper figure are about 16 hours of agent work, so the forecast is two days. A forecast, not a deadline." ;
