ex:Mission12 a backlog:Mission ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 12 to 15 decks and pages meet the owner's rulings on decks and pages"@en ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin "Owner's instruction 2026-11-26 08:37 Istanbul: 'Chapters 12-15, as they are the lecture subjects incoming in the next weeks', in answer to the question which slice the next lineage takes after the read-only sweep of 2026-11-26." ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_InFlight ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "The chapter 12 (Command-Line Programs), chapter 13 (Web Scraping), chapter 14 (Excel Spreadsheets) and chapter 15 (Google Sheets) decks and interactive pages, already released, are corrected so that they meet the owner's rulings on decks and pages (one thing taught per slide, notes that carry the lecture and speak to the reader, a Slide code tab, plain code without prompts, only taught Python, no everyday analogies, checks and reviews recorded before release), with each chapter's approved content, stories and examples unchanged except where a ruling forces a change, reusing the conversion built for chapters 10, 11, 16 and 17." ;
    backlog:missionFor ex:Backlog12,
        ex:Register_Ch1215corr .

