ex:Scope12 a backlog:ScopeStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuild chapter 12 to 15 decks and pages to the owner's rulings"@en ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage12 ;
    backlog:coversArea ex:Area12_Conversion,
        ex:Area12_Deck,
        ex:Area12_NoAnalogies,
        ex:Area12_OwnVersion,
        ex:Area12_Page,
        ex:Area12_PageCode,
        ex:Area12_Reader,
        ex:Area12_Release ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Held, not dropped (2026-11-26): clause (e) of the scope text and the labels of the four PageCode deliverables name a top menu item that runs the slide examples in order. The mission of 1.0.0 does not say it, so the scope must not require it (DeliverableProvenanceShape), and a mission is widened only by the Owner's dated ruling recorded as a GovernanceRuling that a shape enforces (MissionAmendmentShape, G216). The ruling of 2026-11-24 is known here only from the Owner's recorded standing rulings, not from the message itself, and it is not in this repository. One question to the Owner is open: confirm the ruling and its wording so it can be recorded and the mission widened. Until then no goal, objective or story requires the menu item; the PageCode deliverables are required only for the code equal on slide, page and manifest.",
        "The hold of 1.2.0 on the menu item is cleared (2026-11-26 09:29): the Owner confirmed the ruling for every chapter; it is recorded as a GovernanceRuling with its shape, and the mission is widened by amendment (1.5.0). The four PageCode deliverables and clause (e) of the scope text now stand." ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_OwnerStated ;
    backlog:hasScopeDeliverable ex:Del12_Deck_12,
        ex:Del12_Deck_13,
        ex:Del12_Deck_14,
        ex:Del12_Deck_15,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_12,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_13,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_14,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_15,
        ex:Del12_OwnVersion,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_12,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_13,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_14,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_15,
        ex:Del12_Page_12,
        ex:Del12_Page_13,
        ex:Del12_Page_14,
        ex:Del12_Page_15,
        ex:Del12_Reader_12,
        ex:Del12_Reader_13,
        ex:Del12_Reader_14,
        ex:Del12_Reader_15,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_12,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_13,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_14,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_15,
        ex:Del12_Spec_12,
        ex:Del12_Spec_13,
        ex:Del12_Spec_14,
        ex:Del12_Spec_15 ;
    backlog:hasScopeExclusion ex:Excl12_Content,
        ex:Excl12_ExamWork,
        ex:Excl12_LabMaterials,
        ex:Excl12_OtherChapters,
        ex:Excl12_Rdodi ;
    backlog:hasScopeStatementText "IN: chapters 12 (Command-Line Programs), 13 (Web Scraping), 14 (Excel Spreadsheets) and 15 (Google Sheets) of the 3rd edition, in that order. (a) Conversion: each chapter's examples, result visuals, words and plan move into a spec for the generic chapter deck builder, so each deck is rebuilt once. (b) Deck: titles of at least four words, one thing to look at per slide, plain parsing code without prompts, no lambda unless taught, no text frames overlapping, chapter-code manifest equal to the deck's code in order, no slides added (fuller plain sentences go in speech balloons). (c) Reader: notes of 60 to 140 words (at least 30 on title, part and resources slides) written to the reader of the distributed slides, with no directions to a presenter and no think-of statements. (d) No everyday analogies in decks and pages. (e) Page: a Slide code tab equal to the deck code in the same order, code without prompts and without lambda, the full page test passing, a top menu item that runs the slide examples in order. (f) Release: every automatic condition passes and every reviewed condition has a recorded verdict from the academician, the faculty reviewer and the undergraduate reader; each changed file has its own new version. The latest CME and SEN0414 enhancements and the corrections recorded in the chapter 10, 11, 16 and 17 work are applied from the physical files." ;
    backlog:requiresDeliverable ex:Del12_Deck_12,
        ex:Del12_Deck_13,
        ex:Del12_Deck_14,
        ex:Del12_Deck_15,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_12,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_13,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_14,
        ex:Del12_NoAnalogies_15,
        ex:Del12_OwnVersion,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_12,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_13,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_14,
        ex:Del12_PageCode_15,
        ex:Del12_Page_12,
        ex:Del12_Page_13,
        ex:Del12_Page_14,
        ex:Del12_Page_15,
        ex:Del12_Reader_12,
        ex:Del12_Reader_13,
        ex:Del12_Reader_14,
        ex:Del12_Reader_15,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_12,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_13,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_14,
        ex:Del12_ReleaseRecord_15,
        ex:Del12_Spec_12,
        ex:Del12_Spec_13,
        ex:Del12_Spec_14,
        ex:Del12_Spec_15 ;
    backlog:scopeCompletionState backlog:Proposed ;
    backlog:scopeForMission ex:Mission12 .

ex:Executor_ClaudeCodeSession a backlog:Executor_SingleAgent ;
    rdfs:label "The Claude session that carries out the work"@en .

ex:DoD12 a backlog:DefinitionOfDone ;
    rdfs:label "Definition of Done of the chapters 12 to 15 corrections lineage"@en ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage12 ;
    backlog:hasDoDCriterion ex:DoD12_ContentUnchanged,
        ex:DoD12_DeckChecks,
        ex:DoD12_MaterialCheck,
        ex:DoD12_OutsideFiles,
        ex:DoD12_OwnVersion,
        ex:DoD12_PageTest,
        ex:DoD12_ReviewRecord,
        ex:DoD12_RunOrderShape,
        ex:DoD12_StoryRepeat ;
    rdfs:comment "Written for this lineage. A story is Done only when each acceptance criterion has a check run in the current turn with its output saved in the repository, a verify task re-runs it from the files and not from the builder's report, and a check that cannot be run or a result that is not shown leaves the story open." .

ex:Lineage12 a backlog:Lineage ;
    rdfs:label "Chapters 12 to 15 corrections, narrow lineage"@en ;
    backlog:continuesFrom ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:followsProfileDeclaration ex:ProfileDecl12 ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "2026-11-26: the lineage status was not advanced stage by stage while the chain was built (Scope, Goal, Objective); the commits of 1.1.0 to 1.7.0 are the witness of that order. The status pointer (one value, moved in place) and the story and task states are moved in the next merged register, because a delta file only adds statements and a second value would break the single-value rules; until then the lineage pointer still reads Opened and every item reads Proposed.",
        "Owner instruction 2026-11-26 10:41: a lineage's mission may be generated from the course mission, but each is defined to match the intention of that lineage. Applied: the Lineage12 mission (1.0.0, widened once by the Owner's amendment in 1.5.0) states only this lineage's intention, the correction of chapters 12 to 15 on the Owner's rulings, and is not the course mission. The queued lineages (the other chapters, the lab materials) get missions of their own from verified gaps when each is opened, one lineage at a time." ;
    backlog:hasLineageStatus backlog:LS_InProgress ;
    backlog:hasProfile backlog:Profile_AAL ;
    backlog:lineageArchived false ;
    backlog:lineageForMission ex:Mission12 ;
    backlog:lineageOrdinal 12 ;
    rdfs:comment "ex:Lineage2 (sen0414-slides-lineage namespace) is the closed slides lineage this continues from, as Lineage3 to Lineage11 do."@en .

